abstract: >-
  A reference architecture and Quality Engineering framework for designing,
  generating, validating, protecting, provisioning and governing test data for
  conventional software and AI-enabled systems. The work covers deterministic
  factories, synthetic data, AI-assisted generation, privacy risk, schema and
  business-rule validation, provenance, referential integrity, boundary and
  negative data, performance data, RAG/LLM/agent evaluation datasets, tenant
  isolation, cleanup, observability, CI/CD data gates and production-to-
  regression learning. The associated toolkit is explicitly incubating and the
  paper does not claim completed implementation of all described capabilities.